    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Proposition 3.17 . Let L be a frame, a ∈ L , and b a pseudo-complement of a in L . If c ∈ L is maximal relative to the properties a ⩽ c and b ∧ c = 0 , then a ↝ µ c ↓ ."
